Throughout the project, we have used Clause Opus 5.5 for:
-Writing the individual scripts for the website
-Guiding us to configure mock-up data
-Gave us suggestions as to what database to use
-Polishing website visuals

Gemini was used for:
-Writing skeleton codes for simple testing purposes
-Setting up the GitHub repository
-Teaching us the basics of how a website framework functions, from frontend, backend to cloud/third party API

The ideas, as well as the actual structures of the website, are our own ideas and logics. The presentation and the pitch is entirely made by ourselves.